SPOTLIGHTS = True             # point_spotlight (dropped by the importer; CS2 has none) and beam_spotlight (kept by the importer, which CS2 does not have; the same spotlight, turning not rebuilt) -> as CS:GO drew it (point_spotlight.cpp): its beam, an env_laser to an info_target at its length (traced to the first wall), and its halo at the lamp, a second env_laser of the same name; LASERS_TESLAS makes both particles (CSGO_SPOT_*). Color / LightOn (-> TurnOn) / LightOff (-> TurnOff) work. Its dynamic light (named or parented spotlights without spawnflag 2) is not rebuilt
