                              # to a mover: in game only the trigger_hurt rose). It is then drawn as water but is not swimmable (mg_hellz mg15: the rising water
                              # kills through its trigger_hurt anyway). "parent" = the func_water parented to the mover (the old way)
                              # NOTE (not done): porting guides suggest both at once - a func_movelinear carrying a copy of the water faces (the
                              # surface moves) with the func_water parented to it (the swim volume moves). The func_water's own surface stays
                              # drawn where it started (CS2 moves only its collision), so its faces would have to be hidden (toolsnodraw), and
